<title>BELGIUM: CORONA-LOTUS H1 96 PROFIT UP 14.6 PCT.</title>
<headline>CORONA-LOTUS H1 96 PROFIT UP 14.6 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)	 47 vs    41    </p>
<p>    Cons turnover			    1,494 vs 1,470   </p>
<p>    Current net profit			  47 vs    43</p>
<p>    Current net cashflow		     138 vs   133</p>
<p>NOTE - Corona-Lotus NV is a Belgian biscuit maker</p>
<p>For the second half, Corna Lotus saw a large rise in</p>
<p>turnover. Current net profit should be equal or greater than in</p>
<p>the first half, it said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
